For each established phase find the exact effective schedule, permitted partial fraction, cap and authorized conversion basis. Compute earned minor units using exact integer/rational arithmetic and the supplied rounding rule. Subtract only actual issued or authoritatively reserved consumption, less verified credits. A local void request does not release consumed capacity. Keep earned and remaining null where a required number or trigger is unresolved. Preserve every prior earned amount and explain the specific remaining hold instead of inventing a commercial compromise.
